flowchart TD
    A[User Requests Borrow] --> B[Fetch Asset Price from Oracle Sanity Layer]
    B --> C{Is Price Valid and Fresh?}
    C -- No --> D[Reject Transaction: Invalid Price]
    C -- Yes --> E[On-Chain Monitor Validates Borrow Limits]
    E --> F{Is Borrow Within Allowed Limits?}
    F -- No --> G[Reject Transaction: Borrow Limit Exceeded]
    F -- Yes --> H[Lending Protocol Transfers Borrowed Assets]
    H --> I[Emit Borrow Event on Blockchain]
    I --> J[Off-Chain Watchdog Listens to Borrow Event]
    J --> K[Analyze Borrow Behavior & Price Trends]
    K --> L{Anomaly Detected?}
    L -- No --> M[Update Dashboard: Normal Activity]
    L -- Yes --> N[Trigger Emergency Circuit Breaker]
    N --> O[Pause Protocol Functions]
    N --> P[Send Alert to Governance Dashboard]
    O --> Q[Governance Reviews and Takes Action]
